 {"name":"NH Pamplona Iruña Park","aliases":"NH Pamplona Iruña Park|NH Iruña Park|NH Iruna Park","city":"pamplona","description":"A reliable modern NH in the quieter Iturrama quarter, with broad rooms, a strong gym and easy taxis for visitors who value predictable service over old-town noise.","vibe":"calm modern base with practical city connections","tags":"mixed,relax,cozy","hours":"Reception operates 24 hours; restaurant, gym, parking and breakfast vary.","link":"https://www.nh-hotels.com/en/hotel/nh-pamplona-iruna-park","location":"Calle Arcadio María Larraona 1, 31008 Pamplona, Spain","lat":42.81204,"lng":-1.66525,"arrival":"It sits west of the old town; confirm parking, adapted room and late transport during Pride or San Fermín.","best":"Best for value-conscious queer travellers wanting space, gym access and a quieter sleep.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ solo guests and couples mix with business, medical, sports and tour travellers.","dress":"Straightforward city casual.","inclusion":"Minor Hotels publishes diversity and equal-opportunity commitments covering NH properties; no local Pride partnership is asserted.","basis":"Active first-party property page plus current group inclusion framework.","class":"Four-star NH business and leisure hotel","coords":"Exact official address checked 2026-08-28.","sources":["https://www.nh-hotels.com/en/hotel/nh-pamplona-iruna-park","https://www.minor.com/en/sustainability/people"]},

 {"name":"The Randolph Hotel Oxford, a Graduate by Hilton","aliases":"The Randolph Hotel Oxford, a Graduate by Hilton|The Randolph Hotel Oxford|The Randolph Hotel","city":"oxford","description":"Oxford's grand Gothic landmark faces the Ashmolean with dark-blue rooms, literary swagger and a spa, making high ceremony feel playful rather than stiff.","vibe":"collegiate grandeur with theatrical modern confidence","tags":"luxury,cultural,social","hours":"Reception operates 24 hours; spa, restaurants, bar and valet schedules vary.","link":"https://www.hilton.com/en/hotels/oxfgrgu-the-randolph-hotel-oxford-a-graduate-by-hilton/","location":"Beaumont Street, Oxford OX1 2LN, United Kingdom","lat":51.75436,"lng":-1.26007,"arrival":"Central traffic restrictions and historic architecture need advance planning; confirm valet, adapted room and spa access.","best":"Best for queer couples wanting an iconic stay between museums, Pride routes and dedicated nightlife.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ couples mix with academics, alumni, luxury city-break and cultural guests.","dress":"Smart collegiate casual.","inclusion":"Hilton publishes explicit LGBTQ+ travel and workplace inclusion commitments.","basis":"Current corporate inclusion framework plus active first-party property information.","class":"Five-star Graduate by Hilton landmark hotel","coords":"Exact official address checked 2026-08-28.","sources":["https://www.hilton.com/en/hotels/oxfgrgu-the-randolph-hotel-oxford-a-graduate-by-hilton/","https://travel.hilton.com/en_us/articles/lgbtq-travel/"]},
 {"name":"Malmaison Oxford","aliases":"Malmaison Oxford|Malmaison Oxford Castle","city":"oxford","description":"A Victorian prison turned seductive boutique hotel, where original cell doors, iron galleries and moody bedrooms give an Oxford weekend a delicious streak of melodrama.","vibe":"darkly playful prison conversion inside Oxford Castle","tags":"cultural,social,cozy","hours":"Reception operates 24 hours; restaurant, bar, breakfast and parking vary.","link":"https://www.malmaison.com/locations/oxford/","location":"3 New Road, Oxford OX1 1AY, United Kingdom","lat":51.75198,"lng":-1.26353,"arrival":"Historic wings have varied layouts; reserve accessible access, parking and a conventional room if converted cells feel too compact.","best":"Best for queer friends or couples wanting memorable design a short walk from Jolly Farmers.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ weekend guests mix with couples, wedding parties, food travellers and history fans.","dress":"Confident boutique casual.","inclusion":"Frasers Hospitality publishes diversity, equity and inclusion commitments covering Malmaison; no queer ownership claim.","basis":"Active official hotel page paired with current group policy.","class":"Four-star boutique prison-conversion hotel","coords":"Exact official address checked 2026-08-28.","sources":["https://www.malmaison.com/locations/oxford/","https://www.frasershospitality.com/en/about-us/sustainability/social/"]},
