 {"name":"Parador de Santiago de Compostela","aliases":"Parador de Santiago de Compostela|Hostal dos Reis Católicos|Parador Santiago","city":"santiago_de_compostela","description":"A former royal hospital occupying one side of Praza do Obradoiro, where cloisters, carved stone and centuries of arrivals create one of Spain's most extraordinary city stays.","vibe":"monumental pilgrimage history with formal five-star calm","tags":"luxury,cultural,cozy","hours":"Reception operates 24 hours; restaurants, breakfast, parking and guided visits vary.","link":"https://paradores.es/en/parador-de-santiago-de-compostela","location":"Praza do Obradoiro 1, 15705 Santiago de Compostela, Spain","lat":42.88055,"lng":-8.54569,"arrival":"Pedestrian controls and historic levels require advance access coordination; confirm parking, lifts and adapted room.","best":"Best for queer couples making architecture and old-town atmosphere the centre of the trip.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ couples mix with pilgrims, heritage travellers, state guests and gastronomic visitors.","dress":"Elegant historic-city casual.","inclusion":"Paradores maintains equality and non-discrimination commitments across its public hotel network; no queer ownership claim.","basis":"Active first-party property source plus current institutional equality framework.","class":"Five-star historic Parador","coords":"Exact official address checked 2026-08-28.","sources":["https://paradores.es/en/parador-de-santiago-de-compostela","https://paradores.es/en/transparency"]},
