 {"name":"arte Hotel Salzburg","aliases":"arte Hotel Salzburg|arte Hotel Salzburg City","city":"salzburg","description":"A high-rise design hotel above the station whose rooftop bar and panoramic rooms turn Salzburg's domes and mountains into a glowing stage—and whose Pride drag events connect directly to the scene.","vibe":"skyline design hotel with real Pride-week social energy","tags":"social,cultural,mixed","hours":"Reception operates 24 hours; rooftop bar, breakfast, sauna and Pride events vary.","link":"https://www.arte-hotels.at/en/arte-hotel-salzburg/","location":"Rainerstraße 28, 5020 Salzburg, Austria","lat":47.81285,"lng":13.04563,"arrival":"Station traffic is busy but level; confirm adapted room, parking and event access before Pride weekend.","best":"Best for queer friends wanting station convenience, mountain views and a hotel that actively hosts Pride programming.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ Pride guests mix with rail travellers, creatives, business guests and rooftop regulars.","dress":"Design-forward casual to drag-brunch bright.","inclusion":"The property is an active Queer Salzburg programme partner and hosts named Pride drag formats; this is a current event partnership, not an ownership claim.","basis":"Current official hotel source and direct 2026 Queer Salzburg programme evidence.","class":"Four-star Austrian design hotel","coords":"Exact official address checked 2026-08-28.","sources":["https://www.arte-hotels.at/en/arte-hotel-salzburg/","https://www.queersalzburg.at/"]},
