 {"name":"Hotel Sacher Salzburg","aliases":"Hotel Sacher Salzburg|Sacher Salzburg","city":"salzburg","description":"A riverside grand hotel of silk, chandeliers and exacting service, with castle-and-old-town views that make breakfast and late drinks feel unmistakably Salzburg.","vibe":"riverside grand-hotel glamour with operatic poise","tags":"luxury,cultural,relax","hours":"Reception operates 24 hours; restaurants, bars, spa and valet services vary.","link":"https://www.sacher.com/en/salzburg/","location":"Schwarzstraße 5-7, 5020 Salzburg, Austria","lat":47.80276,"lng":13.04312,"arrival":"Festival periods create intense traffic and demand; arrange valet, accessible room and any same-bed preference early.","best":"Best for queer couples celebrating a milestone with old-world ceremony and walkable culture.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ luxury guests mix with opera, diplomatic, culinary and international leisure visitors.","dress":"Elegant city wear; evening venues lean formal.","inclusion":"Leading Hotels of the World and the property operate under published non-discrimination and inclusion expectations; no queer ownership claim.","basis":"Active official property evidence paired with current hospitality-group standards.","class":"Five-star superior independent grand hotel","coords":"Exact official address checked 2026-08-28.","sources":["https://www.sacher.com/en/salzburg/","https://www.lhw.com/corporate/careers"]},
